Engine DLL Licensing
====================

The `Engine/` directory contains pre-built binary DLLs for threat detection.

**Axon Engine** (`Engine/Axon/axon_engine.dll`)
  Open-source under Apache 2.0 at https://github.com/kelomina/Axon_ML

**Raven Engine** (`Engine/Raven/raven_engine.dll`)
  Proprietary component of AnXin Security. Licensed under the same MIT License
  as the main project, provided that it is used solely as an integral part of
  the AnXin Security application. Redistribution, reverse engineering, or
  standalone use outside this context is not permitted without explicit
  written permission.

**Signature Engine** (`Engine/Axon/signature_engine.dll` and
  `Engine/Raven/signature_engine.dll`)
  Proprietary component, deeply integrated into the project. Same licensing
  terms as the Raven Engine above.

Third-party open-source libraries linked into or distributed alongside
these DLLs are governed by their respective licenses. See
`Engine/THIRD-PARTY` for full attribution details.